///   750 px, so the slot shows red over blue.
/// * slot B (1): 990,120 720x720 turned 270° about (1350,480); quadrant
///   photo 1200x1600 with focal point (1, 1) keeps rows 400..1600.
/// * marker: 720,900 360x120 turned 90° about its top-left corner.
